  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Applebee\u2019s Nutrition Calculator\n    </span>\n</p>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n      Meta Title:\n     </span>\n<span>\n      Applebee\u2019s Nutrition Calculator: Calories, Protein &amp; Macros\n     </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n      Meta Description:\n     </span>\n<span>\n      Check Applebee\u2019s calories, protein, carbs, fat, sodium, and other nutrition facts. Compare menu items and calculate nutrition for your complete meal.\n     </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.ft48sqvai0s4\">\n<span>\n     Applebee\u2019s Nutrition Calculator\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Applebee\u2019s meals can include several nutritional components on one plate. An entr\u00e9e may come with potatoes, fries, vegetables, dressing, sauce, cheese, or another side, and each addition changes the final calorie and macro totals.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Applebee\u2019s Nutrition Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to compare available menu items, review calories and nutrients, and combine multiple foods into one meal total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.m2t313kqj6tf\">\n<span>\n     Start With the Full Plate, Not Just the Entr\u00e9e\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     At a sit-down restaurant like Applebee\u2019s, looking only at the main protein can give you an incomplete picture of the meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A steak, grilled chicken entr\u00e9e, burger, pasta dish, or seafood item may be served with sides or toppings that contribute additional:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6 ml-4 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base\">\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Calories\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Carbohydrates\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Fat\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Sodium\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Protein\n     </span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-300\">\n<span>\n      Saturated fat\n     </span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     When the individual components are available in the calculator, add the same sides and extras you plan to order. This gives you a more realistic nutrition estimate than counting only the entr\u00e9e.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.ebxd8duhqchz\">\n<span>\n     Compare Similar Menu Items Side by Side\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Applebee\u2019s menu includes items that may sound similar but have very different nutrition profiles.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, grilled shrimp and fried shrimp are both seafood choices, but preparation changes the amount of fat, carbohydrates, and calories. The same applies when comparing grilled chicken with breaded chicken, a plain burger with a cheese-topped burger, or vegetables with fries.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the nutrition values above to compare the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     specific menu items\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , rather than judging them only by the main ingredient.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.u724nyosmhko\">\n<span>\n     Sauces, Cheese and Dressings Can Change the Total\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Small extras can make a meaningful difference to restaurant nutrition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cheese, bacon, creamy dressings, dipping sauces, glazes, and other additions each contribute their own nutrients. If your order includes several of these, include them in your calculation whenever separate nutrition data is available.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This is especially useful for burgers, salads, wings, sandwiches, and appetizers where sauces or toppings are a significant part of the finished dish.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.l6uxjp8mpefn\">\n<span>\n     Sodium Is Worth Checking Separately\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Many restaurant meals contain much more sodium than you might expect from calories alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Two Applebee\u2019s items with similar calorie totals can have very different sodium values because of seasoning, sauces, cheese, breading, processed meats, and other ingredients.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver shows sodium alongside calories and macros where the value is available, making it easier to compare the complete nutrition profile rather than relying on calories alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.28zohqr8k67w\">\n<span>\n     Build a Complete Applebee\u2019s Meal\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you plan to order several items, add them to the meal builder instead of doing the math manually.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     You might combine:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Entr\u00e9e + side + sauce\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     or\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Appetizer + entr\u00e9e + dessert\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The calculator totals the available nutrition information so you can see how the entire order fits together.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This is particularly helpful with shared appetizers. If several people divide an appetizer, remember that the nutrition for the full menu item is not the same as the amount eaten by one person.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.5kju6mffhecv\">\n<span>\n     Why Applebee\u2019s Nutrition May Change\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Restaurant nutrition data represents standard recipes, but actual orders can vary.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Changes in portion size, substitutions, sauces, side choices, ingredient availability, and restaurant preparation can affect the final meal. Applebee\u2019s also updates its menu, so an older nutrition value may no longer match the current version of an item.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Always compare the item name and configuration in the calculator with the meal you are actually ordering.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.pxs9zrvvxy5c\">\n<span>\n     Applebee\u2019s Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How can I calculate calories in my Applebee\u2019s order?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does changing an Applebee\u2019s side change the calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are Applebee\u2019s salad calories always lower than entr\u00e9e calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Why do Applebee\u2019s calorie numbers sometimes differ between websites?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.o56okxyzfczj\">\n<span>\n     About the Applebee\u2019s Nutrition Data\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver organizes available Applebee\u2019s nutrition information into a searchable format so you can compare menu items and calculate the nutrition of a multi-item meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the results as practical restaurant nutrition estimates. For the latest product-specific information, ingredient details, and allergen information, refer to Applebee\u2019s current official nutrition resources.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
